<title>USA: U.S. stocks open lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials and the Nasdaq composite opened lower on Tuesday, extending Monday's losses with certain segments of the technology sector coming under pressure.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials .DJI off 16.31 at 7273.09.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite .IXIC off 8.14 at 1396.65.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index .SPX off 1.87 at 844.49.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline .AD.N 345/543.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline .AD.O 707/938</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond up 2/32 to yield 6.90 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
